 Inflation gained steam in September, with the annual CPI rate hitting 3.7%, fueling bets on an interest rate hike later this month. AI stocks fell on renewed concerns over debt financing the industry's massive buildout. (See below.👇) 🔥 Today's stock spotlight: Bending Spoons (+41.2%), the tech conglomerate, soared following the disclosure of a new $330 million investment from Berkshire Hathaway.

 
 
