 "Yikes." — Elon Musk, on X , responding to a chart posted by Chamath Palihapitiya showing CoreWeave bond yields hitting 15% today. The AI neocloud company's debt is trading at levels that analysts consider distressed, but CEO Mike Intrator told employees that the market is acting "irrationally." 📉 CoreWeave shares closed down 15.5%.

 
 
